WEBVTT

00:07:27.655 --> 00:07:30.217
and the country's
international reputation.

00:07:31.218 --> 00:07:34.228
I appointed a young attorney
as Commissioner

00:07:34.252 --> 00:07:36.272
for the Anti-Corruption Commission.

00:07:36.296 --> 00:07:37.601
In less than a year,

00:07:37.625 --> 00:07:40.285
he had a hundred percent conviction rate

00:07:40.309 --> 00:07:45.657
and recovered over
1.5 million dollars of stolen money.

00:07:46.366 --> 00:07:50.003
That is seed money for building
the country's first-ever

00:07:50.027 --> 00:07:53.752
national medical diagnostic
center in Sierra Leone.

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:58.695
(Applause)

00:07:58.719 --> 00:08:03.212
The Millennium Challenge Corporation
recently gave us a green scorecard